<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>TIDONG | Digital Platform</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f8fafc;color:#172033}
header{background:#fff;padding:20px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;box-shadow:0 2px 12px #0001}
.logo{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#e11d48}
a{text-decoration:none}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#e11d48;color:white;padding:13px 25px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:100px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff1f2,#eff6ff)}
h1{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,64px);margin:0 0 20px}
.hero p{font-size:20px;color:#475569;line-height:1.7}
.features{max-width:1100px;margin:55px auto;padding:0 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:22px}
.card{background:white;padding:30px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #0001}
.card h2{color:#e11d48;font-size:22px}
.card p{color:#64748b;line-height:1.6}
footer{text-align:center;padding:35px;background:#172033;color:white}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">TIDONG</div>
<a class="btn" href="/login">Log In</a>
</header>
<section class="hero">
<h1>Welcome to TIDONG</h1>
<p>One Digital Platform. Endless Possibilities.<br>
Connecting businesses, customers and services.</p>
<a class="btn" href="/login">Get Started</a>
</section>
<section class="features">
<div class="card"><h2>Shopping</h2><p>Discover a connected digital marketplace.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>Business</h2><p>Tools to manage and grow your business.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>Delivery</h2><p>Connecting orders with delivery services.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>Digital Services</h2><p>Building innovative experiences for everyone.</p></div>
</section>
<footer>TIDONG MARKETING PRIVATE LIMITED</footer>
</body>
</html>